# Line endings: LF in the repository and in the working tree, on every machine (20 Oct 2026). The working
# copy had drifted to a mix — 140 files with CRLF, 9 with both in one file — and every patch made by exact
# match missed when a line ended differently from the one it was written against.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
